title: GameOver
---
Dracula: Ah, my wretched servant.
Dracula: I can see through your pitiful disguise.
Dracula: Dear guests, the dinner has been set. Dig in. 
<<dracuul_bad>>
===

title: Victory
---
Dracula: Ah, welcome dear guest, I think we haven't been introduced yet. 
Dracula: I am Count Dracula and I welcome you to my castle.
Dracula: Can I offer you anything to sate your hunger?
You mumble something in response and excuse yourself. 
You make it to the doors that lead outside from the castle.
<<dracuul_good>>
===
